Third-party notices

Halo: Reach, Halo: The Master Chief Collection, and all associated game
assets, maps, models, textures, audio, and trademarks are the property of
Microsoft Corporation and 343 Industries. They are NOT licensed under the
MIT License above and are NOT distributed with this repository.

Noble is an unofficial, non-commercial community client. It does not contain
or redistribute MCC files: it loads the Halo: Reach engine (haloreach.dll)
and game data from a legitimate, locally installed copy of Halo: The Master
Chief Collection on Steam. You must own the game to use this software.

The menu map, string tables, armour exports and other extracted game data
that the build embeds are generated locally from the user's own MCC install
and are excluded from this repository by .gitignore.

Bundled third-party libraries keep their own licenses:
  - Dear ImGui (MIT)
  - spdlog (MIT)
  - nlohmann/json (MIT)
  - MinHook (BSD 2-Clause)
  - Opus (BSD 3-Clause)
